    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present 18 Cherbury Park Avenue to the market. Tucked away on a quiet, leafy avenue within walking distance of Lucan village, recently upgraded and refreshed throughout, this three-bedroom home offers a fantastic opportunity for a wide range of buyers to secure a property in a premier neighbourhood.\nThe property immediately appeals with its bright and well-proportioned layout. The downstairs consists of a generous, bright living room positioned to the front and a modern kitchen/dining room to the rear. \nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms (two double and one single) and a contemporary family bathroom. The outdoor spaces are equally impressive. The front garden provides convenient off-street parking for family cars. A large portion of The rear garden was slabbed with sandstone in 2025, offering a paved outdoor area that comes equipped with practical additions including an an external power socket and a substantial Barna shed sits to the rear, providing excellent additional garden storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nA bright and welcoming entrance space featuring laminate wood flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 4.62m x 3.68m\nA generous, light-filled family reception room positioned to the front of the property, finished with modern laminate wood flooring and large window.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.62m x 3.27m\nLocated to the rear, the kitchen boasts contemporary wall and floor units, single oven, 4 ring electric hob, under stair storage, access to rear garden, functional layout set upon tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.33m x 2.65m\nA spacious main double bedroom overlooking the rear garden, featuring carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.70m x 2.23m\nA second well-proportioned double bedroom, complete with carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.60m x 2.30m\nA single bedroom to the front finished with carpet flooring, ideal as a child's room or a dedicated home office.\n\nBathroom - \nA contemporary family bathroom suite with WC, WHB, and a bath with overhead shower, finished with tiled flooring.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>G.F.C.H</li><li>Garden </li><li>Private Off Street Parking. </li><li>Private Cul De Sac Location. </li><li>Mature Residential Development</ul>"
      },
